<div class="accordion-area">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title-horizontal">GUI</div>
        <span>Generator GUI</span>
        <div class="card__title-vertical">
            GUI <span><img src="<%= basePath %>images/business/card_arrow.svg" alt="card_arrow" /></span>
        </div>

        <div class="card__summary">
            <ul>
                <li class="type-dot">RestController Generator</li>
                <li class="type-dot">Repository Generator</li>
                <li class="type-dot">DTO Generator</li>
                <li class="type-dot">Widget Generator</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card__detail">
            <p class="h1">GUI</p>
            <span>Generator GUI</span>
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li class="type-dot">RestController Generator</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">Repository Generator</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">DTO Generator</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">Widget Generator</li>
                </ul>
                <dl>
                    <dt>Restful API 개발, API 문서 생성 자동화</dt>
                    <dd>SQL 생성/테스트, SQL 실행 제어</dd>
                    <dd>Json, XML, Del 마스킹, 필드 암호화</dd>
                    <dd>UI Component 생성, React , Vue</dd>
                </dl>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title-horizontal">Console</div>
        <span>Web Admin Console</span>
        <div class="card__title-vertical">
            Console<span><img src="<%= basePath %>images/business/card_arrow.svg" alt="card_arrow" /></span>
        </div>

        <div class="card__summary">
            <ul>
                <li class="type-dot">권한관리</li>
                <li class="type-dot">배치서비스 관리</li>
                <li class="type-dot">온라인 서비스 관리</li>
                <li class="type-dot">모니터링</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card__detail">
            <p class="h1">Console</p>
            <span>Web Admin Console</span>
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li class="type-dot">권한관리</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">배치서비스 관리</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">온라인 서비스 관리</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">모니터링</li>
                </ul>
                <dl>
                    <dt>프로젝트 권한 관리, Console 권한 관리</dt>
                    <dd>배치 스케줄러, 배치 제어</dd>
                    <dd>서비스 제어, 실시간 코드 관리</dd>
                    <dd>로그 뷰어, 서비스 모니터링</dd>
                </dl>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title-horizontal">MSA</div>
        <span>Monolithic Architecture</span>
        <div class="card__title-vertical">
            MSA<span><img src="<%= basePath %>images/business/card_arrow.svg" alt="card_arrow" /></span>
        </div>

        <div class="card__summary">
            <ul>
                <li class="type-dot">분산 트랜잭션 관리</li>
                <li class="type-dot">API GW</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card__detail">
            <p class="h1">MSA</p>
            <span>Monolithic Architecture</span>
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li class="type-dot">분산 트랜잭션 관리</li>
                    <li class="type-dot">API GW</li>
                </ul>
                <dl>
                    <dt>SAGA, MQ ..</dt>
                    <dd>API 버전 관리, 인증/인가..</dd>
                </dl>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
